<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nautica started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nautica started outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co started coverage of Nautica Enterprises Inc with an outperform rating, according to an Oppenheimer source.</p>
<p>-- Nautica shares closed at 32-5/8 on Monday.  </p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer gave Nautica a 12-month price target of $40 a share, the source said.</p>
</text>
